,"owner":"Dana Director","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"}],"documents":[{"id":"un383-template","kind":"UN38.3","p2pRelevant":true,"version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Dana Director","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Dana Director","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Finn Finance","owner":"Dana Director","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"},{"id":"hr-001","kind":"hr-policy","p2pRelevant":false,"version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Dana Director","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Dana Director","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Finn Finance","owner":"Dana Director","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"}],"leadership":[],"finance":[{"id":"signing-limits","title":"signing-limits","body":"Signing authority lives in the ERP user master: each user carries a role and a signing limit, and the approval matrix names which role answers each action. The ERP checks the limit when an approval is recorded; amounts and limits are never copied here. See the user master and the approval matrix for current values.","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Finn Finance","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Finn Finance","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Dana Director","owner":"Finn Finance","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"},{"id":"delegation","title":"delegation","body":"Delegations live in the ERP: each row names who delegates to whom and the window during which the delegate may approve for the owner. While a delegation is active, the delegate's approvals record both parties. See the ERP delegation rows for current windows.","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Finn Finance","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Finn Finance","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Dana Director","owner":"Finn Finance","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"},{"id":"payment-terms","title":"payment-terms","body":"Payment terms live in the ERP vendor master and travel on each invoice. The ERP derives due dates from the invoice date and its terms; terms values are never copied here. See the vendor master for current terms.","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Finn Finance","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Finn Finance","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Dana Director","owner":"Finn Finance","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"}],"procurement":[{"id":"sourcing-policy","title":"sourcing-policy","body":"Concentration on critical battery cells stays capped at vendor award, including the prospective lot. The caps come from company memo MEMO-0001 (Dana Director, September 15 2026), approved by Finn Finance on September 24 2026 and effective October 1 2026 as ACT-0012 (CORP-01) and ACT-0013 (CORP-02). Exceptions need Finance approval and stay logged with approver, time, and reason. Cap figures live on the versioned rules; they are never copied here.","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Dana Director","createdAt":"2026-09-15T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Dana Director","modifiedAt":"2026-09-15T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Finn Finance","owner":"Dana Director","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-10-01"}],"hr":[{"id":"approval-roles","title":"approval-roles","body":"Who approves what lives in the ERP users and the approval matrix: users carry roles, and each matrix row names the owner role and named owner for one action. Knowledge edits need their space owner's approval, and editors never approve their own change. See the ERP users and the approval matrix for current assignments.","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Dana Director","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Dana Director","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Finn Finance","owner":"Dana Director","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"}],"regulatory":[{"id":"data-residency","title":"data-residency","body":"Data residency. Company data stays within approved systems: the ERP, the case store, and the approved model endpoint. Operational documents — purchase orders, invoices, shipment notices, dock photos, and board memos — may be processed by the approved model endpoint for transcription, matching, screening, and explanation. HR documents and other restricted records must never be sent to the model and can never ground a rule. Vendor bank details are used only to match and pay the invoice that carries them. Personal data is minimized in every model request, and employee records are never bulk-exported.","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Dana Director","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Dana Director","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Finn Finance","owner":"Dana Director","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"},{"id":"un38-3-summary","title":"un38-3-summary","body":"A UN38.3 test summary is required for the cell/battery type (BAT-LI-01: UN38.3 test summary available for the cell/battery type. Source: UN Manual of Tests and Criteria Part III §38.3; IATA lithium battery guidance; 49 CFR 173.185)","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Dana Director","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Dana Director","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Finn Finance","owner":"Dana Director","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"},{"id":"iata-marks","title":"iata-marks","body":"Lithium-battery marks on outer cartons must be visible and legible (BAT-LI-03: Lithium-battery mark visible and legible on the outer carton. Source: IATA DGR Fig 7.1.C mark; 49 CFR 173.185(c)(3); IMDG SP188 BAT-LI-04: Class 9 diamond and Cargo Aircraft Only handling visible when required. Source: IATA DGR Class 9 handling; 49 CFR 173.185)","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Dana Director","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Dana Director","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Finn Finance","owner":"Dana Director","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"}],"operations":[{"id":"critical-parts","title":"critical-parts","body":"Critical-part flags live on the ERP item master. Document packs apply to critical parts only; other parts move straight through without pack checks. See the item master for current flags.","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Maya Planner","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Maya Planner","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Dana Director","owner":"Maya Planner","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"},{"id":"dock-safety","title":"dock-safety","body":"The dock gate is photo-only. Every inbound carton is checked from its photos: the lithium-battery mark must be visible and legible (BAT-LI-03), the Class 9 diamond and Cargo Aircraft Only handling must be visible when required (BAT-LI-04), and any suspected outer damage goes to human review (BAT-LI-05). Photos never set quantities — ordered and received counts come from the ASN and ERP receipt only. An ASN carton missing from every image goes to human review, and illegible labels are re-shot and re-transcribed before any decision. Nothing auto-quarantines on a photo alone: a human decides from the model crops, quarantine flips the lot's inventory status with a paired hold, and putaway plus payment stay blocked until every review on that lot closes.","version":"kbv3","createdBy":"Maya Planner","createdAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","modifiedBy":"Maya Planner","modifiedAt":"2025-12-10T00:00:00+00:00","approvedBy":"Dana Director","owner":"Maya Planner","status":"Active","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01"}],"mirrorUsers":[{"id":"Maya Planner","role":"requester","signingLimit":5000,"limitCurrency":"USD"},{"id":"Dana Director","role":"approver","signingLimit":50000,"limitCurrency":"USD"},{"id":"Del Delegate","role":"dated-delegate-for-Dana","signingLimit":50000,"limitCurrency":"USD"},{"id":"Amy AP Clerk","role":"ap-clerk","signingLimit":0,"limitCurrency":"USD"},{"id":"Finn Finance","role":"payment-approver","signingLimit":100000,"limitCurrency":"USD"}],"mirrorVendors":[{"id":"V-A","name":"CinderVolt Energy Ltd","country":"CN"},{"id":"V-B","name":"Meridian Cellworks Inc","country":"MX"},{"id":"V-C","name":"Formosa Fasteners Co","country":"TW"}],"mirrorPaymentTerms":[{"id":"NET30","netDays":30}],"mirrorHistory":{"itemId":"BAT-1","rows":[{"source":"V-A CN active","country":"CN","cells":3400},{"source":"Legacy CN inactive","country":"CN","cells":2500},{"source":"V-B MX active","country":"MX","cells":3800},{"source":"Other non-CN","country":"OTHER","cells":300}]},"$comment":"Company KB v3 (company truth). Every entry carries its named author and approver with December 2025 authorship and January 2026 effect, except sourcing-policy (September 2026 authorship, October 2026 effect). Leadership space opens empty; memos are the leadership record."}